<title>UK: ICI to offer ICI Australia stake.</title>
<headline>ICI to offer ICI Australia stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Chemical Industries Plc said on Wednesday it intended to sell its 62.4 percent stake in ICI Australia Ltd through a global equity offering, subject to market conditions.</p>
<p>ICI said in a statement announcing its purchase of Unilever's spciality chemicals business that it had appointed Goldman Sachs as adviser to the offering.</p>
<p>The company said it would be in discussion with the board of ICI Australia &quot;to establish the basis on which existing commercial relationships between the two companies will continue in the future.&quot;</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
